1. To initialize, you need to update your Java version to 25. 
- Please check and download the correct version for your system.===>>> https://www.oracle.com/java/technologies/downloads/ 

2. In VScode extentions, install "Extention Pack for Java" and "Spring Boot Extension Pack"

3. Go to ..\SBU_25F_CSE416\backend\src\main\java\edu\sbu\cse416\sam_system\SamSystemApplication.java and press control + shift + p

4. Click "Java: Clean Java Language Server Workspace"

5. Go to ..\SBU_25F_CSE416\backend\src\main\java\edu\sbu\cse416\sam_system\SamSystemApplication.java and press "Run Java" button, which is located in upper right side

6. Go to ..\SAM\SBU_25F_CSE416\frontend and install packages using "npm install"

7. run by typing "npm run dev"